      "role": "user",
      "content": "oh okay good to know. i was a little worried but i really dont want to go to the doctor just for swelling. it seems like such a small thing and the clinic is so far away. do u think i should just take some extra water or maybe some ibuprofen to help with the inflammation? i just want to feel less puffy so i can sleep better.",
